     "t": "code",
     "lang": "text",
     "code": "Q154: Polymorphism\n  Cat: Meow!\n  DogP: Woof!\n  Duck: Quack!\n\n  Vector(1, 2) + Vector(3, 4) = Vector(4, 6)\n  |Vector(3, 4)| = 5.00",
